# The Guacamole binary artefacts are NOT committed. They are ~23 MB of
# Apache-licensed release binaries that would sit in this repository's history
# for ever, and they are reproducible from a URL and a checksum that ARE
# committed (SHA512SUMS, next to this file).
#
# Stage them with:  bash tools/vendor-guacamole.sh
# The installer reads this directory and never writes to it.
*.war
*.jar
*.tar.gz
*.sql
